### TITLE ###
CursorTracksTheTextAcrossAWrapBoundary
### DESCRIPTION ###
Moving left over a wrap point puts the caret at the end of the row above, not
at a column that no longer holds that character. Rows and cursor come out of
one layout pass so they cannot disagree.
### PROMPT ###
>
### WIDTH ###
12
### KEYS ###
"abcdefghijkl"
left
left
left
enter
### VALUE ###
abcdefghijkl
