### TITLE ###
MaxHeightScrollsInsteadOfDrawingPastTheScreen
### DESCRIPTION ###
The renderer walks back up over the rows it drew, so a block taller than the
terminal would scroll off the top and corrupt every redraw after it. The editor
windows onto the cursor instead.
### PROMPT ###
>
### CONT_PROMPT ###
.
### MAX_HEIGHT ###
2
### POLICY ###
never
### KEYS ###
"one"
enter
"two"
enter
"three"
enter
enter
